  "prefLabel": "Ncr 741.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 741.02 Applicability. The provisions of Ncr 740 shall apply to all department of natural and cultural resources (department) properties, and subsequent properties and easements upon acquisition, and facilities, structures, and improvements thereon and to all listed conservation or trail easement properties held by the department to the extent that these provisions apply to the rights granted to the state or the restrictions placed on the property.\n\nSource. #14056 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14292, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr700.html"
